WEBVTT

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.190
You were really cool!

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.110
I've decided!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.480
The first Pokémon I catch will be you!

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.200
In the Galar Region,
Go caught his first-ever Pokémon; Hibunny!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.330
Director Sakuragi!

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.290
What's up with the screen
on my Smartphone Rotom?

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:28.290
Oh, you see, that Pokémon Index
has two functions.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:31.800
The first is to tell you
a Pokémon's typing and characteristics.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:36.300
The second is to list
the Pokémon you've caught.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.430
The Pokémon I've caught?

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.220
That's right.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:43.180
The more Pokémon you catch,
the more this list will fill out.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.690
Wow, they can do that?!

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.770
So this is my...

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:51.110
My very own Go Index?!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:53.240
Look!

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:00.990
I'm starting to feel like catching
loads of Pokémon to fill out the Index!

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:04.460
All right, wanna go
get some right now?

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.080
Yeah! Let's go!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.470
Hey, you still not ready? C'mon, hurry up!

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:21.050
You all packed and ready to leave?

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:23.770
I'll show you this wide mysterious world

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.640
And skip the slow send-off

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.980
Be it through fire or through water

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.650
I'm fumbling blindly through the days

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:36.150
When I don't even know what the next second will bring

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:41.410
Each and every one of my memories

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:46.000
Can always be found inside a Ball

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.920
On 1, 2, 3, dive in!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:55.670
I've got the future plans I imagined in my pocket

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:02.680
Greeting someone new is always fresh

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:06.890
No need (No need!) to hesitate! Try! (Try!)

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.230
Let's have a fight!

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.940
1: Once the battle's done

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.770
2: And we're laughing or crying

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:17.110
On 3, let's be friends!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:23.780
Any day and every day, that's always been my rule

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:29.120
With this unpredictable, boundless world awaiting

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.630
Let's go! Every time you trip and fall

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.750
Let's go! You pick yourself up by my side

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.510
I choose you!

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:46.520
The Road to Mew!!
I Got Loads of Pokemon!

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:51.730
This way! This way!

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.150
Looks like there'll be
loads of Pokémon here!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:02.570
I brought tons of Monster Balls, too,
so let's get catching!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:04.030
Awesome!

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:08.000
Hibunny,
tell me if you find a Pokémon.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.750
What's up, Pikachu?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.500
C'mon!

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.000
Yeah!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:23.840
It's a Poppo!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.310
All right! Let's catch it!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.930
Monster Ball... Go!

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.270
What? Right away?!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.240
Ow...

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.870
Was that Wind Gust?

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.540
Be careful, Go...

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:50.410
If you don't catch them,
they'll strike back at you.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:51.330
Got it...

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.960
Hibunny, let's find
another Pokémon!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.460
It's a Pidgeon!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.130
Wait, Hibunny!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.690
You really have
good ears, Hibunny.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:22.530
But if you're too loud,
the Pokémon will flee.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.360
So you have to remain calm.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.870
A Digda!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:32.830
A chance!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.840
No, Hibunny!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.170
Over there?!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.840
Hibunny! Listen to-

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.390
Hey! Hibunny!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.390
Looks like they're
being played with...

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.360
Now it's a Dugtrio!

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.410
Go! Leap off!

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:14.120
I can catch it from here, too!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.420
You all right, Go?

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:25.510
Yeah... This isn't
really working, though.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.800
Hibunny, don't rush even if
you find something.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.070
A Caterpie!

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.280
Calmly... Calmly...

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.070
It'll flee if we're too hasty.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.040
Monster Ball, go!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.790
Nice!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.760
All right! Got it!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:13.760
Caterpie's data will be
added to the Index!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.020
You did it, Go!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.060
Yeah!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.440
It's all thanks to you, Hibunny!

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.690
Any other Pokémon I can
catch around here?

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:31.660
These Pokémon live here!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.370
Lots of Bug Pokémon.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.960
Then I'll start by completing
Caterpie's evolutionary line!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.040
Transel and Butterfree, huh?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.750
Hibunny!
We'll start by finding Transel!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.670
Pikachu, let's help them look!

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.810
Turns out they're not
easy to find...

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.690
True.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.150
Up that tree?

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.780
Ready, and...

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.200
Ow!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.210
Ouch!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.170
Transel?!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.170
You're mine!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.150
Transel's data will be
added to the Index!

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:47.400
All right! I got Transel!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:52.650
A Butterfree?!

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:55.410
No, that's a Morphon!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.580
I'll catch you, too, then!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:16.010
Morphon's data will be
added to the Index!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.680
All right!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.270
Paras!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.270
There's a Parasect, too!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.980
The Pokémon controlled by
its mushrooms, huh?

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.740
Wait, this isn't the time
to study them!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.950
Keep it up! Monster Balls, go!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.410
Great!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:50.460
Paras and Parasect's data will be
added to the Index!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:53.800
A double catch!

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.430
There's Butterfree!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.810
Wait for me, Butterfree!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.980
Monster Ball, go!

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.280
What?!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.400
Go!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.240
Right!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.460
Is there something here, too?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.960
Hurry, Satoshi!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.250
Go, you go on ahead!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.380
Huh? Oh, okay!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.050
Stay still...

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.760
You're up, Hibunny!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:47.890
All right!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:58.240
Butterfree's data will be
added to the Index!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.950
All right!
That's Butterfree caught!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.700
Now I've completed
Caterpie's evolutionary line!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.330
Thanks, Hibunny!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.050
That's...

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.640
Kaiross! Stag Beetle Pokémon!
Bug type!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:26.140
It grips prey with its powerful pincers
and will not let go until the prey is torn in half!

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.940
Lightning Speed!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:39.910
Good, Pikachu!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.830
Satoshi, Pikachu!
Are you okay?!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:50.960
We're fine!

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.650
Kaiross's data will be
added to the Index!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.190
For real?

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:16.980
You're a pro at this, Go!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.900
S-Sure am!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.490
Catching loads of Pokémon
is tons of fun!

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:27.490
I'm starting to want to
catch some, myself!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:30.000
Pokémon Trainers
gotta catch Pokémon, yeah?

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:38.260
Looks like Hibunny
found something!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:39.590
Pikachu, too!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.880
Let's split up!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.010
Sure!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:52.270
Strike! Mantis Pokémon!
Bug/Flying type!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:56.480
It tears and shreds prey with
its wickedly sharp scythes!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.900
A Flying type with
sharp scythes, huh?

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.360
Go!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.000
Go and Hibunny are blasting off!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:25.470
.Bug.
Flying
Strike

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.680
Owwww...

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.350
You okay, Hibunny?

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:31.770
Where's Strike?!

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.190
It got away, huh?

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.900
It was crazy strong.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:41.440
I'll catch it the
next time I see it, for sure!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.650
What other Pokémon
can I catch around here?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:48.620
These Pokémon live here!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.080
Beedle! You're mine!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:11.100
Beedle's data will be
added to the Index!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.430
All right!

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:15.850
Then I'll complete this line next!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:23.320
Cocoon, the Cocoon Pokémon, is Beedle's evolved form,
so it might reside close to Beedle!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.820
There! There're loads of them!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.820
And the Cocoon I've accepted is...

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.240
...you!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:47.090
Cocoon's data will be
added to the Index!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:47.880
All right!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:52.510
Next up is Spear, which is Cocoon's evolved form,
so it should be somewhere near...

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.690
I wonder if Go and Hibunny
caught anything else?

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.400
Satoshi!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:08.320
Hey! Here I am!

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.530
Run!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.210
Spear!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.460
Oh, no! They're too fast!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.040
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.800
That one seems the strongest! Go!

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.440
Spear's data will be
added to the Index!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:49.240
All right!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.570
Awesome!
You've even caught Spear?

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.950
Yeah! That completes
Beedle's evolutionary line!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.870
What? Already?

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.080
Check out the Pokémon
I've caught!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:05.210
Huh! Just two more,
and I'll have all the Bug types in Kanto!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.960
Strike and Konpang, huh?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.630
Strike got away earlier,
but I still have a shot!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:15.180
Konpang is nocturnal, so during the day
it might be sleeping inside a tree!

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:16.260
There!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.740
Monster Ball, go!

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.950
Weaken it through battling!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.660
No, this is faster!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.460
Hibunny?!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.840
You wanna battle?

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.590
All right, then!
Lightning Speed!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:55.550
Great!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:01.890
That was Poison Powder!

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.520
No big deal!

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.190
Hibunny! Use Double Kick!

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:10.860
Go!

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.780
Great!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.960
Konpang's data will be
added to the Index!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:27.380
All right!
That only leaves Strike!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.590
Hibunny?!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:33.170
You've gotta hurry to a Pokémon Center
to deal with Konpang's poison!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.470
All right!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.100
Where's the nearest
Pokémon Center?

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.390
Here!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:50.610
Good afternoon, and welcome to
the Pokémon Center!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:56.280
We can heal your Pokémon's wounds and ailments
and recover their stamina for you here.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.290
My Hibunny's been hit
by Poison Powder.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.700
Please, help!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.290
I'll take your Pokémon, then.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.920
We've restored your Pokémon
to full health.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.550
Thank you very much!

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.590
Come out, Hibunny!

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.810
What a relief!

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:22.970
I'm sorry.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:28.350
I was so obsessed with catching Konpang
that I didn't pay attention to you.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:28.900
Sorry!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.940
Will you help me
catch Pokémon again?

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.330
All right!
Let's get that Strike!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.040
Sounds great!
I wanna get Strike, too!

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.290
Then let's compete to see
who gets it first!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.830
Okay!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:51.340
Hibunny, we gotta win this!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:17:59.640
You find it?!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.260
That's Strike!

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.600
Good, Hibunny!
Get back for a second!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:08.900
Go!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:13.440
This is my last one...

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.320
Let's do this, Hibunny!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.080
Lightning Speed!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.670
You dodge, too!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:33.420
Very good!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.210
You're kidding!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:39.430
Too bad!
I'm <i>always</i> one step ahead!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.650
<i>Sure</i> you are!

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:43.430
But you gotta catch it, Go!

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.430
Yeah!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.270
Hibunny! Use Double Kick!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:54.570
You gotta close in more like, <i>Fwooo</i>, and then finish it, like, <i>Ka-pow!</i>

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:57.620
"Fwooo"? "Ka-pow"?
What does that even <i>mean?</i>

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.290
Calm down, Hibunny!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.330
It's crazy fast!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.920
But if we approach this calmly,
we can do it!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.260
Lightning Speed!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.580
Now!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.510
Monster Ball, go!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.930
Excellent!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:39.650
Strike's data will be
added to the Index!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:45.200
I did it! Now I've got
all twelve Kanto Bug types!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.040
That's amazing, Go!

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.160
Hibunny,
it's all thanks to you!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.880
Isn't it rare for them
not to be here for breakfast?

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:06.180
Yes... Perhaps they're still asleep?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.140
Stop it!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.440
What are you doing?

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:22.280
Go! Do something!

00:20:22.280 --> 00:20:25.530
Very good! Catching Pokémon
and interacting with them...

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:27.950
...will deepen
our understanding!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:29.660
This is what I want from
my research fellows!

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.750
Isn't this room
too cramped, though?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:32.870
Don't worry!

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.920
You can entrust the Pokémon you've caught
to my Sakuragi Park!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.260
Really? This is great!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.680
Looks like they're having fun!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.350
Wasn't Mew supposed to be
your first catch?

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:53.310
Mew is said to have
the genes of all Pokémon...

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:56.560
I couldn't fulfill my dream of
having it be my first Pokémon...

00:20:56.560 --> 00:21:00.940
In which case, I'll catch every Pokémon,
to get closer to Mew!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.570
That future, too,
lies in my hands, yeah?!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.570
Every Pokémon? Sounds fun!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:09.830
What about you, Satoshi?

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:10.790
Me?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.450
My dream is to be
a Pokémon Master!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:15.830
What's that?

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.790
You mean, like, becoming
the world's greatest Pokémon Trainer?

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.710
More than that!
It's so much more!

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.170
I'm not sure I get it...

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.590
But that's great!
Keep at it, Satoshi!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.720
Yeah! You, too!

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.800
Sure!

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:33.350
As close friends and
fierce rivals,

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:36.940
Satoshi and Go swore to each other
to pursue their dreams!

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.730
Tomorrow, their endless path
will continue!

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.480
Let's go!

